function codex(){libraryReturn=state;state='library';setOverlay(`<section class="library"><div class="library-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">KNOWLEDGE IS YOUR REAL UPGRADE</div><h1>Field codex</h1></div><button class="secondary" id="closeCodex">RETURN ↙</button></div><p>All nine resources from the <a href="https://www.spaceappschallenge.org/2026/challenges/space-mission-design-game/?tab=resources" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">2026 challenge resource list</a> are indexed below. Inclusion is not a claim of software integration or complete curriculum coverage.</p><p><b>Model:</b> solar power = array power at 1 AU ÷ distance² × illumination. Battery change = (generation − demand) × seconds ÷ 3600. One play second represents 30 electrical-system seconds. Scan energy, dash costs, hardware values, opponents, heat and contact windows are designed for gameplay. Terrain scale, travel, launch and timing are not realistic simulations. Gravity is informational in this version; orbital flight, propulsion and live NASA data are future work.</p><div class="sources">${sources.map(s=>`<article class="source"><small>${s.status.toUpperCase()}</small><h3>${s.name}</h3><p>${s.use}</p><a href="${s.url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OPEN ORIGINAL RESOURCE ↗</a></article>`).join('')}</div></section>`);$('closeCodex').onclick=()=>{if(libraryReturn==='hangar')showHangar();else if(libraryReturn==='play')resume();else if(libraryReturn==='pause'){state='play';pause();}else if(libraryReturn==='upgrade')upgrade();else if(libraryReturn==='result')result(run.finished);else showHangar();};}
